<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Grainger said added to list.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Grainger said added to list.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- W.W. Grainger Inc was added to the recommend list at Dean Witter on Friday, according to a Dean Witter source.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/8 to 74-1/4.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
